## Exit criteria

- [ ] Probe requires inventory of the paper's own appendix/code robustness,
  already-run/excluded checks with reasons, code anomalies as candidate checks,
  and fair comparisons to the original estimate.
- [ ] The plan fixes reporting before execution: every planned check receives
  a completed/failed/blocked/withdrawn disposition with reason; amendments
  preserve history and require renewed signature; no pass-count verdict.
- [ ] A design-specific candidate-menu reference exists; each item cites two
  actual I4R reports from inspected source material or a named methods source
  supporting that item. RDD entries are explicitly methods-derived; no claims
  of certified inventory counts or empirical RDD coverage.
- [ ] Applicability and robustness/heterogeneity/extension scope are explicit;
  drop-one units follow assignment/clustering/design rather than a universal
  observation-level rule. Case variables, tuned thresholds, and units stay in
  the paper folder.
- [ ] Validation-only blindness accounts for prior exposure and excludes
  exposed heldout comparisons; ordinary report appraisal is unchanged.
- [ ] The person-written signature gate, four verbs, computational ACRe/table,
  and existing1568/1569 guidance remain unchanged. No numerical run occurs.

## Plan and evidence

One generic probe edit plus one attributed reference. Read the original
source inventory/PROTOCOL only; do not read heldout I4R43/107. Inventory
categories and approximate frequencies are discovery aids, not validated
method recommendations. Inspect actual support for every menu item; a named
methods source is an alternative to two report examples. Validate by a
source-to-item audit and semantic diff, not wording tests. Run declared lint
and fast checks, then gaze and verify-gate. A source gap is a blocker for the
unsupported item, never permission to invent its attribution.

Imagine inherited from1570: four premise checks accepted with qualifications.
Blind-Spot findings incorporated: complete dispositions and rule5 scope
classification. Planner requested Luna medium; source access declined by that
worker, while receiving lead read pinned sources under explicit read-only
authorization. Observed identities masked; no lineage independence claimed.

Feasibility PASS with source-audit dependency: current probe and rules supply
